{"about_the_game":"A young man prepares for his parents return from Uncle\u2019s Mansion, in the sunny state of Florida, when suddenly an internal conflict strikes. Becoming lost in a deep hunger for companionship, his stomach cries out for something to fill that emotional gap. Will the kitchen have the answers he is looking for? Perhaps. Will his passion escalate things far beyond reason? Absolutely.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay through the story of a young man\u2019s quest to create the ultimate BLT sandwich. Maybe even try to find love along the way? If not that\u2019s cool too. It\u2019s up to you to decide how you make the magic happen in Kitsune Kitchen, a hyperbolic visual-novel and an experience that you won\u2019t soon forget.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"93d8c146a7204fafc31d69bfe2b0d4407eb960a5.jpg","localized_name":"Super Secret Hush Hush","name":"Super Secret Hush Hush","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862920/93d8c146a7204fafc31d69bfe2b0d4407eb960a5.jpg"},{"icon":"eb89431742ab53ce0155832859eb9fdc6c6604d5.jpg","localized_name":"Fridge End","name":"Fridge End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862920/eb89431742ab53ce0155832859eb9fdc6c6604d5.jpg"},{"icon":"5dd1616601ce7ceecc480b78b4ed9c024bd623fc.jpg","localized_name":"Toaster End","name":"Toaster End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862920/5dd1616601ce7ceecc480b78b4ed9c024bd623fc.jpg"},{"icon":"b388ba84e3014948975fdef3b9753cb76e7a89c6.jpg","localized_name":"Pan End","name":"Pan End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862920/b388ba84e3014948975fdef3b9753cb76e7a89c6.jpg"},{"icon":"10b89e15e8975ddca6ddd331761d94784b97462e.jpg","localized_name":"Knife End","name":"Knife End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/862920/10b89e15e8975ddca6ddd331761d94784b97462e.jpg"},{"icon":"fb2151297e58b49074fb